      propertyPath: tutorialEvents.Array.data[0].subtitle
      value: '"En garde" is a French phrase that can be directly translated as "get
        ready" or "prepare to fight."

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8295121625142137509, guid: 5b3bf46aab5a41e44b7a033888d19828, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialEvents.Array.data[1].subtitle
      value: "First, let's look at your feet. If you're a righty, point your front
        foot toward me and turn your back foot out 90 degrees. If you\u2019re a lefty,
        do the opposite."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8295121625142137509, guid: 5b3bf46aab5a41e44b7a033888d19828, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialEvents.Array.data[2].subtitle
      value: "Next, bend those knees. Make sure your knees are right over your toes.
        Proper knee bend is the key\u2014it allows you to move sharply and react
        instantly"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8295121625142137509, guid: 5b3bf46aab5a41e44b7a033888d19828, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialEvents.Array.data[3].subtitle
      value: 'Now, let''s move. To Advance, lead with your front leg. Notice the
        detail: your heel must touch the ground first, followed by your toe. Don''t
        just shuffle; lead with that heel.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8295121625142137509, guid: 5b3bf46aab5a41e44b7a033888d19828, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialEvents.Array.data[4].subtitle
      value: To Retreat, move your back foot first, and your front foot follows.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8295121625142137509, guid: 5b3bf46aab5a41e44b7a033888d19828, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialEvents.Array.data[5].subtitle
      value: Now you can practice on the mannequin. We'll continue when you're done.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8295121625142137509, guid: 5b3bf46aab5a41e44b7a033888d19828, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialEvents.Array.data[6].subtitle
      value: "Let\u2019s do it a few times together."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8295121625142137509, guid: 5b3bf46aab5a41e44b7a033888d19828, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialEvents.Array.data[0].boardIcon
